#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"TrackShip for WooCommerce integrates TrackShip into your WooCommerce Store "
"and auto-tracks your orders, automates your post-shipping workflow and "
"allows you to provide a superior Post-Purchase experience to your customers."
msgstr ""
"TrackShip for WooCommerce integra TrackShip nel tuo negozio WooCommerce e "
"traccia automaticamente i tuoi ordini, automatizza il flusso di lavoro post-"
"spedizione e ti consente di fornire un'esperienza post-acquisto superiore ai "
"tuoi clienti."

#: trackship-for-woocommerce.php:136
msgid "TrackShip for WooCommerce requires a Shipment Tracking extension."
msgstr ""
"TrackShip for WooCommerce richiede un'estensione di tracciamento delle "
"spedizioni."

#: includes/views/setup.php:29
msgid ""
"TrackShip is syncing fulfillment-based shipments automatically. All new "
"fulfillments will be tracked in real time."
msgstr ""
"TrackShip sincronizza automaticamente le spedizioni basate sui fulfillment. "
"Tutti i nuovi fulfillment saranno tracciati in tempo reale."

